our strategy and make every decision count as you build your path to victory. But don't try to memorize where resources stand since no two games have the same world. That's right world changes from round to round with different resources placements, enemy spawns weather conditions, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312420/extras/loot.gif?t=1747137483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312420/extras/Fortify.png?t=1747137483\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312420/extras/city_low_res.gif?t=1747137483\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Empower your attacks, use gold, upgrade buildings, unlock new ones and fight for Regera. As the game progresses enemies get stronger, nemeses come to challenge your heroes and armies grow larger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312420/extras/ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1747137483\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312420/extras/Harnes.png?t=1747137483\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On sunny days, workers are more productive, gathering extra resources to fuel your defenses. But beware the nights\u2014your towers can't see far, and golems emerge from their hideouts, their glowing eyes casting fear over the villages. Storms can wreak havoc on your buildings and cripple resource production, adding yet another layer of challenge to your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" sr